<div class="container mt-4" style="max-width: 680px;">
  <h1>Import Invoice Dates from PDI</h1>
  <p class="text-muted">
    PDI's order API doesn't send invoice dates, which sales and delivery time on the
    <%= link_to 'Financial Dashboard', financial_dashboard_path %> depend on. Export them from PDI's database and upload them here.
  </p>

  <div class="alert alert-info">
    <strong><%= number_with_delimiter(@missing) %> billed PDI orders</strong> have no invoice date yet.
  </div>

  <%= form_with url: preview_pdi_invoice_date_import_path, method: :post, multipart: true, data: { turbo: false } do |f| %>
    <div class="card shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="mb-3">
          <%= f.label :file, 'Invoice dates export (.csv)', class: 'form-label fw-semibold' %>
          <%= f.file_field :file, class: 'form-control', accept: '.csv' %>
        </div>
        <%= f.submit 'Preview Import', class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <div class="card shadow-sm mt-3">
    <div class="card-header fw-semibold">File layout</div>
    <div class="card-body small text-muted">
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>CSV with a header row. Columns are found by name, in any order:
          <strong>order number</strong> (e.g. <code>OrderNo</code>, <code>OD-051224-26</code> values),
          <strong>invoice date</strong> (e.g. <code>InvoiceDate</code>), and optionally <strong>invoice number</strong>
          (<code>InvoiceNo</code>) and <strong>salesperson</strong>.</li>
        <li>Dates as <code>2026-10-03</code>, <code>2026-10-03 00:00:00</code> or <code>10/03/2026</code>.</li>
        <li>Orders are matched on the PDI order number. Orders not in the app are skipped.</li>
        <li>The file's invoice date replaces the app's; invoice number and salesperson only when the file has them.</li>
        <li>Safe to run again: unchanged orders are left alone.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%= render 'shared/import_history', logs: @logs, download_path: :download_pdi_invoice_date_import_path %>
</div>
